  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Meatballcraft/bh_header.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"378\"></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>本整合包目前為預發布狀態！所有內容均已開放，且可達成所有結局！</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>在 1.0 正式版推出前，可能會有一些平衡性調整更新！</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong style=\"font-size:24px\">CurseForge 自動更新通常會重置路標與按鍵綁定。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>若要保留這些設定，請安裝到新的配置檔中，並複製「saves」資料夾、「journeymap」資料夾以及「options.txt」檔案！&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>點擊</strong> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fshorturl.at%252f7HBff\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>這裡</strong></a> <strong>即可取得 Java 25 安裝設定！</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fclients%252faff.php%253faff%253d4184\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Meatballcraft/bh_promo.png\"></strong></a></span></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fWVvVm7aWh3\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0KI1Onh.png\" width=\"220\" height=\"70\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmmcreviews.com%252fall%252fmodpacks%252fmeatballcraft-dimensional-ascension%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jOysJ7C.png\" width=\"184\" height=\"70\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fhosted_button_id%253dKWGAX4ZRGWUWQ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7FayrGX.png\" width=\"220\" height=\"85\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WFlIQ5o.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"1126\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Meatballcraft/bh_4.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Jk6jPYM.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"750\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vLY13No.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"750\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/v0zQ672.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"750\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3oOLqT0.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"750\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7PqWi5E.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"750\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/pEo7088.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"750\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YqPcAbi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"750\"><br><img src=\"blob:https://imgur.com/7daa283c-507b-4b22-9f31-ff19a4720d91\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DyiZbKy.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"750\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lBBnuZA.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"750\"><img src=\"blob:https://imgur.com/da0527a4-aa9b-4460-b74f-d4e32f4daffa\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"blob:https://imgur.com/da0527a4-aa9b-4460-b74f-d4e32f4daffa\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"blob:https://imgur.com/da0527a4-aa9b-4460-b74f-d4e32f4daffa\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"blob:https://imgur.com/f38e035a-b47b-4dc5-9bd8-de9b09d74bea\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Oyxvxpz.png\" alt=\"chap10\" width=\"1521\" height=\"1014\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Meatballcraft/bh_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"111\"><span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/IxGwYUi.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"750\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Meatballcraft/bh_12.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"111\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ylFA0dR.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"750\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Meatballcraft/bh_5.png\"><span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lONMWlU.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"750\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Meatballcraft/bh_6.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3jzK2HI.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"750\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Meatballcraft/bh_8.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">感謝 IterationFunk 的整合包開發 YouTube 系列影片！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">感謝協助測試的各位夥伴！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">感謝 DivineRPG 的開發與更新團隊，這是我童年最喜愛的模組之一。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">感謝 Multiblock Madness、FTB Interactions、SevTech Ages、Divine Journey、Enigmatica 2 與 Omnifactory 的製作團隊。你們真的給了我很大的靈感！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">感謝 Joanna 和 Warlocknload 為本網頁製作了精美的像素藝術！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">感謝所有試用過本整合包並提供反饋的玩家！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
